              "text": "59",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Erae lu ŋituŋa ŋulu apote alo Teli-Mela, Tel-Arisa, Kerub, Adon ka Imer tari ŋina pa apedoritotor ikes akitoodiun ŋatekerin kec, kori atemar arae ikes ŋiletok a Ŋisirael: ",
