          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "63",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "aŋun, abu ekepukan tolimok ikes atemar nyemaikina ikes kimuja ŋamuja ŋuna itesegitae, mati kilamilam esacaradoti toyenunia ŋakiro ŋuna emaikina ikes kitiyata.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
