          "text": "Arae ekimar a ŋituŋa a daadaŋ a ŋulu apotu toboŋut Yerusalem alo Babilon ŋalipyo ŋatomoniomwon ka ŋaarei ka ŋamiae ŋauni ka ŋatomonikanikapei, ",
